{
  "id": "point-4-3",
  "title": "What is a Specification Language?",
  "shortSummary": "解释 specification language 的组成、表达力与可分析性要求，并区别于编程语言。",
  "keyTerms": [
    "specification language",
    "表达力",
    "可分析性",
    "语义"
  ],
  "animationType": "none",
